---
import ContentLayout from '@/layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout section="legal" title="Cookie policy" heading="Cookie policy" updated="5 October 2026">
  <p>We keep cookies to the minimum, so there is no cookie banner. If we add non-essential cookies later, we will ask first.</p>
  <h2>Cookies we use</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Lasts</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>cf_currency</td><td>Remembers USD or GBP</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
      <tr><td>cf_session</td><td>Keeps you signed in to your account</td><td>30 days</td></tr>
      <tr><td>CF_Authorization</td><td>Staff login to the admin (Cloudflare Access)</td><td>Session</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>Browser storage</h2>
  <p>Your cart, wishlist and recently viewed items are saved in your browser (local storage) so they are still there next time. They are never sent to us until you check out.</p>
  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies or track you across sites.</p>
</ContentLayout>
